<===> README.md
# Hue of rgb colors with a missing green channel

When converting to hsl or hwb, the maximum was compared against the optional
green channel (always false if missing), instead of its value (zero).
<===>
================================================================================
<===> hsl/green_max/input.scss
@use "sass:color";
a {b: color.to-space(color(srgb 0.2 0.8 0.5), hsl)}
<===> hsl/green_max/output.css
a {
  b: hsl(150, 60%, 50%);
}
<===>
================================================================================
<===> hsl/in_gamut/input.scss
@use "sass:color";
a {b: color.to-space(color(srgb 0.2 none 0.5), hsl)}
<===> hsl/in_gamut/output.css
a {
  b: hsl(264, 100%, 25%);
}
<===>
================================================================================
<===> hsl/out_of_gamut/input.scss
@use "sass:color";
a {b: color.to-space(color(srgb -0.2 none -0.5), hsl)}
<===> hsl/out_of_gamut/output.css
a {
  b: hsl(264, 100%, -25%);
}
<===>
================================================================================
<===> hsl/out_of_gamut_red/input.scss
@use "sass:color";
a {b: color.to-space(color(srgb -0.6 none -0.1), hsl)}
<===> hsl/out_of_gamut_red/output.css
a {
  b: hsl(350, 100%, -30%);
}
<===>
================================================================================
<===> hue_channel/input.scss
@use "sass:color";
a {b: color.channel(color(srgb -0.2 none -0.5), "hue", hsl)}
<===> hue_channel/output.css
a {
  b: 264deg;
}
<===>
================================================================================
<===> hwb/out_of_gamut/input.scss
@use "sass:color";
a {b: color.to-space(color(srgb -0.2 none -0.5), hwb)}
<===> hwb/out_of_gamut/output.css
a {
  b: hsl(264, 100%, -25%);
}
<===>
================================================================================
<===> srgb_linear/out_of_gamut/input.scss
@use "sass:color";
a {b: color.to-space(color(srgb-linear -0.2 none -0.5), hsl)}
<===> srgb_linear/out_of_gamut/output.css
a {
  b: hsl(279.5342030319, 100%, -36.7678491526%);
}
